  "question": {
    "text": "The magnetic flux linked with a coil satisfies the relation $\\phi=4 t^{2}+6 t+9$ Wb, where $t$ is the\r\ntime in second. The emf induced in the coil at $t=2 \\mathrm{s}$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "NFRo7",
      "text": "$22 \\mathrm{V}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
